<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Password</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>password
</pre>
<p>You choose a password when you create your character. It must be at least 
5 characters long, and only its first 8 characters count: those must mix 
letters with digits or symbols, and use plain letters only (no accents).
</p><p>To change it, type password, written out in full. You are asked for the 
new password, one word of 5 to 16 characters, and then asked to type it 
again. Choose one you don't use anywhere else, and never tell it to 
anyone: no admin will ever ask you for it.
</p><p>Your password is stored encrypted, so not even the admins can read it. If 
you forget it, ask for help on Valhalla's Discord, 
<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://discord.gg/vmha2rGRA2">discord.gg/vmha2rGRA2</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Immortal</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Save</a>
</pre>




</div>